          "kind": "variable",
          "name": "loomiIcon",
          "description": "Renders a Heroicon's inner SVG inside an `<svg>` element, loading that one icon on\nfirst use: `` svg`<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">${loomiIcon(\"bell\")}</svg>` ``.\n\nRenders synchronously when the icon is already registered, provided or loaded;\notherwise it renders nothing and fills in once the icon's module arrives. Check\nhasLoomiIcon first when an unknown name should fall back to something else."
        }
      ],
